OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker brings you
OL,7,     Fexclusive performances from home
OL,8,     Fand abroad, today including
OL,9,     FLiszt's 1st Piano Concerto and the
OL,10,     Ffinal part of Robert Schumann's
OL,11,     FParadise and the Peri.
OL,12,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FLive from St Martin-in-the-Fields
OL,14,     Fto mark the 300th anniversary of
OL,15,     Fthe completion of the building of
OL,16,     Fthe Church, including music by
OL,17,     FNils Greenhow, Klatzow and Cecilia
OL,18,     FMcDowall.
